      <h1>AI Use</h1>

      <p>BriefPicks uses automation and AI-assisted tools to research, organize, draft, caption, and produce short-form buying briefs and destination content.</p>
      <p>AI-assisted production does not remove the requirement for source-backed claims. Each published brief must be based on at least one source-backed claim and must avoid fake hands-on or review language.</p>
      <p>Unless BriefPicks clearly says otherwise, product content is based on public information such as published specifications, manuals, retailer or booking-platform information, official sources, and other public data, not personal product testing.</p>
      <p>AI-assisted output may still contain errors. Check source pages, retailer listings, booking terms, availability, suitability, safety information, and official sources before buying or booking.</p>
      <p>Realistic AI-generated or meaningfully altered media is disclosed or labelled where applicable platform rules require it.</p>

